CM_ "ANUMAAN engine telemetry v2 (card M7-01): every monitored channel, one message set per published frame. 29-bit proprietary J1939-range ids 0x18FF1000-0x18FF1005. The all-ones raw value of every signal means NOT AVAILABLE (J1939 convention), so a missing reading arrives as null, never as a number. Counter = 4-bit rolling sequence per message for the intrusion detector. Signal ranges are physical plausibility limits (wider than any operating limit); a value outside them is flagged by the intrusion detector.";
BA_DEF_ BO_ "GenMsgCycleTime" INT 0 65535;
